# Data contract (pipeline → web)

web/public/data/targets.json   index: [{id, name, kind, file}]
web/public/data/targets/<id>.json:
  target:   {id, name, kind, ra, dec}
  grid:     {size_px, pixel_scale_arcsec, center_ra, center_dec,
             orientation: "north up, east left, row 0 = top"}
  units:    "MJy/sr"
  detectors:{D1:[lo,hi] µm, ...}
  epochs:   [{id, label, mjd_start, mjd_end,
              frames: {D1: {n_images, pixels: [[...]], flagged_fraction}}}]
  # later: spectrum[], gaia_predicted[]
web/public/data/manifest.json  {generated_at, collections, release, counts}

Rules: rows flipped (FITS row 0 = bottom). NaN -> null. Missing epoch/detector -> omit key.
The live API returns the SAME per-target shape.
